flowchart TB
    accTitle: Brook awaited continuation
    accDescr: Awaited work persists origin correlation and causal evidence before dispatch. Reply validation and atomic result delivery lead to fresh context; invalid or duplicate replies never resume work.
    call["Async tool: await-result<br/>Fire-and-forget has no continuation"]
    admit["Atomic admission + pending receipt<br/>Origin + pins + authorized outbox"]
    send["Dispatch after commit<br/>Preserve logical effect identity"]
    reply["Authenticate correlated reply<br/>Status / expiry / cancellation"]
    accept["Atomic outcome + origin delivery<br/>Invalid or duplicate: no resume"]
    context["Assemble current bounded context<br/>Revision check at admission"]
    run["Fresh harness invocation<br/>Preserve newer session activity"]
    call --> admit
    admit --> send
    send -->|later result| reply
    reply --> accept
    accept --> context
    context --> run
